      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A case of rectus sheath hematoma is described. Computed tomography demonstrated a still active bleeding from an aneurysm which was situated at the junction of the inferior and superior epigastric artery. The recognition of a continuous hemorrhage contributed to the decision of an immediate surgical intervention."},
